      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Daisy (데이지) <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Characters\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/3/36/Characters.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150527022122\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Characters.png\" data-image-key=\"Characters.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/6b/DaisyPortrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20150613212354\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"DaisyPortrait\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/6b/DaisyPortrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20150613212354\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/6b/DaisyPortrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20150613212354 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/6b/DaisyPortrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20150613212354 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"DaisyPortrait\" width=\"227\" height=\"293\" data-image-key=\"DaisyPortrait.png\" data-image-name=\"DaisyPortrait.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Name</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Daisy (데이지)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"age\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Age</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"height\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Height</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">158cm</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occup\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Baker</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"firstintroduced\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Introduced In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lastseen\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ongoing</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Daisy</b> is a baker who regularly stops by <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>'s shop for potions. She uses the potions to make breads.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Personality\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Personality</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Character_Quest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Character Quest</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Challenge_Quest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge Quest</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dialogues\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogues</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDaisy%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/9/9e/DaisyProfile.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150614094802\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Info on Daisy.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DaisyProfile.jpg\" data-image-key=\"DaisyProfile.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/9/9e/DaisyProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614094802\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/9/9e/DaisyProfile.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150614094802\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Info on Daisy.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/9/9e/DaisyProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614094802\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"DaisyProfile.jpg\" data-image-key=\"DaisyProfile.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/9/9e/DaisyProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614094802\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:DaisyProfile.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Info on Daisy.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Daisy is a polite baker who always greets <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\">Tia</a> before asking for potions. When her request is not fulfilled, she does not get upset\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Character_Quest\">Character Quest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDaisy%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge_Quest\">Challenge Quest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDaisy%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Daisy's quest requires a large quantity of level 1 potions. When quest is completed, 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Likeability\" title=\"Likeability\">likeability</a> points are rewarded to the current character.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogues\">Dialogues</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDaisy%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&a